<title>NETHERLANDS: Commercial Union's Delta Lloyd H1 profit up.</title>
<headline>Commercial Union's Delta Lloyd H1 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)	    53.00   vs   49.88</p>
<p>    Net profit			     174.9    vs  164.6</p>
<p>    Turnover (bln)			   2.98   vs    2.69</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Delta Lloyd Verzekeringsgroep NV. The insurer is a fully-owned subsidiary of U.K.'s Commercial Union Assurance Plc.</p>
</text>
